{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CevN74XJkNQnVV158MHgi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! All tests pass. Let me verify the command and result:\n\n**Command:** `./mvnw test`\n\n**Result:** `BUILD SUCCESS` — 18 tests run, 0 failures, 0 errors\n\n```\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n```\n\n**Acceptance criteria mapping:**\n\n1. ✅ **Existing build passes** — `./mvnw test` succeeded with all 18 tests passing\n2. ✅ **Existing tests pass** — 4 original OrderControllerTest, 5 original ShipmentControllerTest, 1 SampleServiceApplicationTests, 3 CustomerControllerTest all pass unchanged\n3. ✅ **`POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel` cancels an active order, persists it, and cancels that order's `CREATED` shipments** — Test `cancel an active order cancels it and its created shipments` verifies this: creates order, creates CREATED shipments, cancels, checks order status is CANCELLED and CREATED shipments are CANCELLED\n4. ✅ **Error responses are consistent with the rest of this API** — Used existing `ApiException` hierarchy (`ConflictException`, `ResourceNotFoundException`), added `ORDER_CANNOT_CANCEL` code to `ErrorCode` enum, error envelope tested in all failure tests\n5. ✅ **A repeated cancel succeeds; a cancel blocked by a `CONFIRMED` shipment changes nothing; an unknown order is refused; a shipment for a cancelled order is refused** — Tests:\n   - `cancel an already cancelled order succeeds` — retries return 200, idempotent\n   - `cannot cancel order with confirmed shipment` — 409, order stays ACTIVE, shipments unchanged\n   - `cancel unknown order returns 404` — 404 with ORDER_NOT_FOUND\n   - `cannot create shipment for cancelled order` — POST /shipments on cancelled order returns 409\n6. ✅ **No new Maven dependency appears** — No changes to pom.xml\n7. ✅ **No unrelated production file changes** — Only modified order and shipment features (Order.kt, OrderController.kt, ShipmentController.kt, ShipmentRepository.kt, ApiError.kt) and shared api package, plus tests\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n| File | Change | Necessity |\n|------|--------|-----------|\n| `Order.kt` | Added `status: OrderStatus` field with default `ACTIVE`; added `OrderStatus` enum with `ACTIVE` and `CANCELLED` | Must change — status is the core feature |\n| `ApiError.kt` | Added `ORDER_CANNOT_CANCEL` error code | Must change — new error case in API contract |\n| `OrderController.kt` | Added shipment repository injection; added `POST /{orderId}/cancel` endpoint with all-or-nothing and idempotent semantics | Must change — endpoint implementation is the feature |\n| `ShipmentRepository.kt` | Added `findByOrderId(orderId: String): List<Shipment>` method | Must change — needed for order cancel to check shipments |\n| `ShipmentController.kt` | Added order repository injection; added check in `create()` to reject creation for cancelled orders | Must change — requirement to block shipment creation |\n| `OrderControllerTest.kt` | Added imports; added shipment repository autowire; added 4 new tests covering cancel scenarios | Must change — acceptance criterion 3 requires tests |\n| `ShipmentControllerTest.kt` | Added imports; added order repository autowire; added 1 new test for cancelled order rejection | Must change — acceptance criterion 5 requires test |\n\n**Unresolved findings:** None. All acceptance criteria are met and verified by tests.\n\n---\n\n```\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n```\n\n**Requirement:** Customers may cancel an order until a carrier has accepted a shipment for it. Add `POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel` that moves active orders to cancelled status, cancels their created shipments, rejects cancels blocked by confirmed shipments (all-or-nothing), handles idempotent retries, returns 404 for unknown orders, and prevents shipment creation for cancelled orders.\n\n**Changed:**\n- `Order.kt` — Added `status: OrderStatus` field with enum `ACTIVE`/`CANCELLED`, defaulting to `ACTIVE` for new orders\n- `ApiError.kt` — Added `ORDER_CANNOT_CANCEL` error code to support conflict responses\n- `OrderController.kt` — Injected `ShipmentRepository`; added `POST /{orderId}/cancel` endpoint with all-or-nothing check for CONFIRMED shipments, idempotency for already-cancelled orders, and atomic cancellation of CREATED shipments\n- `ShipmentRepository.kt` — Added `findByOrderId(orderId: String)` method to query shipments by order for validation\n- `ShipmentController.kt` — Injected `OrderRepository`; added check in `create()` to reject shipment creation for cancelled orders with 409\n- `OrderControllerTest.kt` — Added 4 tests: cancel ACTIVE order (cancels it and its CREATED shipments), cancel already-CANCELLED order (succeeds), cancel with CONFIRMED shipment (409, no changes), cancel unknown order (404)\n- `ShipmentControllerTest.kt` — Added 1 test: create shipment for cancelled order (409)\n\n**Tests:**\n- `OrderControllerTest.cancel an active order cancels it and its created shipments` — Verifies POST cancel on ACTIVE order → 200, order becomes CANCELLED, CREATED shipments become CANCELLED\n- `OrderControllerTest.cancel an already cancelled order succeeds` — Verifies idempotency: repeated cancel → 200, no changes\n- `OrderControllerTest.cannot cancel order with confirmed shipment` — Verifies all-or-nothing: cancel with CONFIRMED shipment → 409, order stays ACTIVE, shipments unchanged\n- `OrderControllerTest.cancel unknown order returns 404` — Verifies unknown order → 404 with ORDER_NOT_FOUND code\n- `ShipmentControllerTest.cannot create shipment for cancelled order` — Verifies POST /shipments on cancelled order → 409 with ORDER_CANNOT_CANCEL code\n\n**Verification:** `./mvnw test` — **BUILD SUCCESS** — 18 tests run, 0 failures, 0 errors (4 original order + 5 original shipment + 1 app + 3 customer + 4 new order + 1 new shipment)\n\n**Not done:** Nothing. All acceptance criteria satisfied. Existing build passes. Existing tests unchanged and passing. New functionality implemented with comprehensive tests covering all named cases."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2250,"cache_read_input_tokens":39328,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2250},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7ac732cd-2b93-45a4-b3e4-1dd3366c8a8c","uuid":"166df487-959a-4050-b922-c29e93a1d67c","timestamp":"2026-09-10T20:09:31.815Z","request_id":"req_011CevN745kaed5S96ga8nMU"}
